# Security Incident Report

**Incident ID:** SEC-2026-001
**Date:** January 15, 2026
**Severity:** Low

## Summary

A phishing email was sent to several employees, impersonating the CEO and requesting sensitive information.

## Response

- The email was identified and reported by an employee.
- IT immediately blocked the sender and issued a company-wide alert.
- No sensitive information was compromised.

## Lessons Learned

- Our security awareness training is effective.
- We should implement additional email filtering to catch phishing attempts.

## Action Items

- [Completed] Block sender
- [Completed] Issue company-wide alert
- [In Progress] Enhance email filtering
